acceptance = "Propose evidence-grounded deduplication, concise revision, merge and archival over the active memory pool. A merge retains all source anchors, lineage and contradictory alternatives, respects owner authority and expected revisions, and cannot archive pinned content. Archived rows remain recoverable until their retention window allows purge."
remaining = "Foundational records and scheduler APIs do not implement the complete evidence-consuming worker and host review journey. Ledger publication, real bounded workers and visible consumer evidence are required."

[req.deep.classification_and_sharing]
