acceptance = "Retain pinned observations, required lineage and competing evidence through explicit retention windows. Tombstones immediately exclude recall, injection and derived publication. After eligibility, an authorized purge removes raw and derived copies according to declared key/storage semantics with an inspectable plan and receipt. Backup/export retention policy states which copies remain and why."
remaining = "Foundational records and scheduler APIs do not implement the complete evidence-consuming worker and host review journey. Ledger publication, real bounded workers and visible consumer evidence are required."

[req.deep.compact_memory_cues]
